<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation in Bhiwadi (RJ-02 NCR) | Covered Car Carriers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad protect my car from scratches during loading and unloading in Bhiwadi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every vehicle is loaded onto our enclosed hydraulic ramp trailers using padded, non‑abrasive rollers and a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system. Professional loaders wear soft‑grip gloves, and the trailer interior is lined with high‑density foam and anti‑scratch films. This combination, backed by a zero‑scratch guarantee, ensures that hatchbacks, SUVs, and luxury cars arrive spotless.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What paperwork is required for car transportation from Bhiwadi to other Indian cities?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid vehicle registration certificate, a government‑issued photo ID, a signed service agreement, and a copy of your insurance policy. For corporate or PSU moves, an IBA‑approved GST invoice is generated automatically. Our team also assists with e‑Way bill creation to comply with transport regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the 850 km car shipment from Bhiwadi typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, our multi‑axle express freight trucks cover the 850 km route in 12‑14 hours door‑to‑door. Real‑time GPS tracking allows you to monitor progress, and any unforeseen delays are communicated instantly. The transit time includes loading, secure fastening, and a final safety inspection before delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it travels from Bhiwadi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every Shree Ashirwad trailer is equipped with a satellite GPS unit that streams live coordinates to a secure customer portal. You receive SMS alerts at key milestones—pickup, departure, border crossing, and arrival. This transparency gives you full visibility of the Car Transportation In Bhiwadi journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for car transport in Bhiwadi and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While optional, we strongly recommend our IRDAI‑approved full‑coverage insurance, which is included in the quoted price. It protects against accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural disasters for the entire transit distance. In the unlikely event of a claim, the declared value is settled promptly, ensuring zero financial loss.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does pricing differ between a hatchback and a luxury vehicle for Bhiwadi car shifting?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on vehicle size, weight, and required protective measures. Hatchbacks and sedans use standard 18‑ft containers with basic tie‑downs, while luxury cars need custom wooden crates, extra foam layers, and climate‑controlled cabins, resulting in a higher rate. A transparent cost matrix is provided in the quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I ship my car on a train instead of a road carrier from Bhiwadi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Car transport on train is available but involves additional handling, limited schedules, and higher paperwork, such as railway consignment notes. Our road‑carrier solution offers door‑to‑door service, live tracking, and a faster 12‑hour transit for the 850 km corridor, making it the preferred choice for most customers.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
